      "content": "You do not have to survive this moment alone, as professional help can guide you through the shame and offer you the dignity you desperately seek. Please consider re-framing this crisis as a chance to rebuild a new sense of worth rather than viewing your entire life as an irreversible failure. I strongly urge you to reach out to a crisis line or mental health professional immediately, as the wish for a different outcome now often means immediate life-ending consequences later in this very way.",
